WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Browse the catalog
Open Shop or Search to narrow the catalog. Read the item and seller
before opening the product.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose a product label
Brands uses available A–Z letters. Clear the selected letter to see all
loaded brands; a tile opens matching products.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Meet the seller
Read the seller page and its product collection. The vendor sells the
item; the brand is its label.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Choose the exact variant
Check the selected option, current price and availability. Wishlist
saves a variant without reserving stock.
